summary:
Beautiful tributes and remembrances today at the funeral of #Texans co-founder Janice S. McNair at St. Luke's United Methodist Church where Cal McNair and Andre Johnson spoke eloquently about her life and honored her legacy of giving.  'She was exceptional,' Cal McNair said. 'Thank you for the love, thank you for the example for everyone.'
'Ms. Janice had a way of making you feel at home,' Johnson said. 'She changed lives. We love you, we'll miss you.'
Among those attending: J.J. Watt, Gary Kubiak, Mayor John Whitmire, DeMeco Ryans, C.J. Stroud, Nick Caserio, Mike Tomon, Greg Grissom, Owen Daniels, Will Anderson Jr., Danielle Hunter, Ka'imi Fairbairn, Azeez Al-Shaair, Rod Wright, Chester Pitts, Frank Okam, Travis Johnson, Earl Mitchell, Xavier Hutchinson, Dalton Schultz City Controller Chris Hollins and many, many others.
